      "writtenOn": "2025-01-31T00:27:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, right, not signal safe... Yea, we can\u0027t exhaustively worry about that...\n\nLet\u0027s add that documentation note.\nAnd add a CMake dependency on addr2line...\n\nAlso, let\u0027s enable this in debug and maintainer build configs, it certainly is handy.",
      "parentUuid": "2b053009_60059fbf",
      "revId": "054bdefc7e1ae8273fa148e33ff53e08db508085",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
